# Add version and date-released when the first release is selected; see RELEASING.md.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Kidney-Genetics in your research, please cite this repository and the exact revision or archived release used.
type: software
title: 'Kidney-Genetics: A reproducible and curated database of kidney-related genes'
abstract: Kidney-Genetics compiles a curated database of kidney-related genes from PanelApp, literature, clinical diagnostic panels, Human Phenotype Ontology annotations, and PubTator. R analysis scripts merge and annotate these sources, and bookdown documentation presents the resulting gene tables.
url: https://halbritter-lab.github.io/kidney-genetics-v1/
repository-code: https://github.com/halbritter-lab/kidney-genetics-v1
license: MIT
keywords:
  - kidney disease
  - gene curation
  - genomics
  - nephrology
  - bioinformatics
